# Migration Skill Auto-Invoke (DBS-FFW)

User က skill/path name **မပြောဘဲ** prompt intent မှ **Read** — implement မတိုင်မီ skip **မလုပ်**။

---

## Baseline / Bulk (Wave 0–3)

**Triggers (EN/MM):**
bulk, baseline, scaffold, wire, wired, တန်းပြောင်း, အားလုံး, all pages, all web parts, re-scaffold, inventory sync, baseline wave

**Note:** page/WP name တစ်ခုတည်း (`Ffw`, `index.aspx`, `PastEvents`…) = bulk **မဟုတ်** → parity / one-slice

1. Read `bulk-classic-to-spfx-baseline/SKILL.md`
2. Sync `docs/migration/PARITY.md` ↔ repo-root `progress.md`
3. Scope = **multiple live routes** OK in one wave
4. Status = **wired / baseline** only — **no parity PASS** claim
5. Rule `18-bulk-migration-baseline.mdc` constraints apply

---

## Parity / Visual (Wave 4 · one slice)

**Triggers:**
parity, visual, pixel, classic match, classic နဲ့, spacing, hover, font, font-weight, font weight, ထူ, ပါး, bold, underline, OpenSans, breakpoint, visual QA, parity PASS

1. Read `classic-to-spfx-migration/SKILL.md`
2. Then `classic-visual-parity` → **`visual-typography.md` (required)** → `uikit-to-spfx-visual-parity` (UI tasks)
3. Scope = **one web part / one classic page** — bulk parity **reject**
4. Status = **parity PASS** only after visual checklist

---

## Swiper / Carousel (functional + visual)

**Triggers:**
swiper, carousel, slider, gallery slider, winner-slider, swiper-button, slidesPerView, gallery swipe, winner slide

1. Read `swiper-to-spfx-carousel/SKILL.md` (+ `references/classic-configs.md` if wiring init)
2. Load `classic-visual-parity` for nav button / slide CSS (not vendor bundle CSS)
3. `npm i swiper` = **user approval first**
4. Scope = one slice or one slider section — site-wide dep without ask **reject**

---

## SPFx Scaffold / Data (any migration)

**Triggers:**
web part, SPFx, gulp, manifest, serve.json, list, PnP, SPHttpClient

→ Read `spfx/SKILL.md` (+ `references/` only if needed)

---

## Ambiguous (ဝေဝါးသည်)

**Examples:** "spfx ပြောင်းပေး", "migrate classic", "classic → SPFx" (mode unclear)  
Single name "Ffw" without bulk words → one-slice, not bulk

→ Clarify-first **one question:** baseline bulk (wire all) vs parity slice (one WP polish)?  
→ User confirms → load matching skill above. **Do not guess** parity vs baseline.

---

## Always (migration)

- `_cursor/rules/17-classic-host-and-assets.mdc` — one WP per classic page; **no hub pageKey router**
- **Pins:** SPFx 1.20 · gulp · React 17 · Fluent v8 · no Heft/v9 · deps ask-first

---

## Reject routing to (route မလုပ်)

- `mk/.cursor/` or skill `classic-spfx-migration` (hub playbook — wrong for this repo)
- parity PASS during baseline triggers
- Entire-site parity PASS in one turn
